.el .ds Aq '
.TH batten-perf-pair 1  batten 
.SH NAME
batten\-perf\-pair \- Measure this branch and its merge base back to back on one machine, and print both arms as paired records
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbatten perf pair\fR [\fB\-\-null\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Measure this branch and its merge base back to back on one machine, and print both arms as paired records
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-null\fR
Measure HEAD against itself, so the ratio is the noise floor rather than a comparison
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
